  "body": "All agents buyers welcome, contact Vivian for conjunctional.\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of sought-after Bucklands Beach, this spacious and versatile family home offers the perfect combination of comfort, convenience, and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented brick-and-tile, two-level family home offers three bedrooms plus a spacious rumpus, providing plenty of room for growing families. Breathtaking sea views stretching across Eastern Beach and Rogers Park - the perfect backdrop to enjoy your morning coffee or unwind at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nThe flexible layout allows family members to spread out and enjoy their own space, while the seamless flow between living areas makes entertaining effortless.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of nearby beaches, parks, local shops, cafes, and public transport, all while living in a friendly and established coastal community.\r\n\r\nThis home is located in a prestigious educational zone, including Bucklands Beach Primary, BBI, and Macleans College. Enjoy an easy walk to the serene walkways of Bucklands and Eastern Beaches, the Half Moon Bay ferries, and short drive to Musick Point and Howick Golf Club.\r\n\r\nA stand-out coastal home in a location with a reputation for quality education and walk to the seaside that will never cease to be amazing - call at Team Tina for viewing arrangements.",
